  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Summer Rolls.png|left|200px|Summer rolls]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 78\n |price = 1 to 316\n |time = 1 h\n |source = {{Infoicon|saladb|bigger|link=Salad Bar}}\n |xp = 38\n |base = 88\n |dia = 4\n |time3 = 51 min\n}}\n'''Summer rolls''' are [[products]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 78.\n\nLike all [[products]], they are stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Making summer rolls'''===\n[[File:Salad Bar.png|150px|left|Salad Bar]]\nSummer rolls are made in the [[Salad Bar]].\n\nTo make the rolls, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Rice Noodles.png|75px|Rice noodles|link=Rice Noodles]]\n|[[File:Carrot.png|centre|75px|Carrots|link=Carrot]]\n|[[File:Lettuce.png|centre|75px|Lettuce|link=Lettuce]]\n|[[File:Chili Pepper.png|75px|Chili pepper|link=Chili Pepper]]\n|-\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 1 hour to make summer rolls, and 51 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] kitchen. Each plate gives players 38 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Selling summer rolls'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside shop]]\n* Summer rolls can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 3168 {{Infoicon|coin}} for 10 units.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make summer rolls costs 282 {{Infoicon|coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 2 summer rolls per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Sommerrollen\n|es = Rollitos de verano\n|fr = Rouleaux d'Eté\n|it = Involtini estate\n|nl = Vietnamese Loempia\n|no = Sommerruller\n|zh = Summer Rolls\n}}\n[[pt-br:Enroladinho vegano]]\n[[ru:Летний рулет]]\n[[Category:Salad Bar Products]]\n[[Category:Carrot Products]]\n[[Category:Chili Pepper Products]]\n[[Category:Lettuce Products]]\n[[Category:Rice Noodles Products]]",
